    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="checks if subgroup values under screening possible matches (Main Dashboard - Actions for review) match the values in the profile" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Verify Sub-group Value Consistency</p>
            <p>Checks if the sub-group value from Screening Possible Matches (Actions for Review) matches the sub-group value in the client profile.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>1. Wait for the dashboard to load. 2. Click on the "Screening Actions for Review" card. 3. Retrieve the sub-group name from the pending actions table. 4. Open the first client record from the list. 5. Navigate to the "Profile" section. 6. Assert that the sub-group value matches the retrieved one.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The sub-group value in the client profile matches the one displayed in the Screening Pending Actions list.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Execution">
       <chapter title="Run Individual Test">
           <code-block lang="bash">
